Confirmed: the single OnboardingScreen is the boarding screen. The bug: user can fling the PageView past page 2 (provider step) while the gate is active, reach the final page, and press "Open Fa" — authorizing the app without a provider/model configured.

The fix: block forward swiping past the provider page while the gate is active. Options:
