Simpler and robust: use NeverScrollableScrollPhysics while on the gated page. Downside: while gated and on page 1, the user can't swipe back to page 0 — but they can press Back (onBack is enabled when _page > 0). Acceptable? The ticket says "disable swiping". Simplest per ticket.

